# File splitting

- **UI:** one main component per `*_ui.tsx` file is fine; colocate small private helpers in the same file when they serve that screen.
- **Business logic:** group by **domain/feature file** (e.g. `practice_association.ts`, `practice_session_view_state.ts`), not one file per micro-concern (labels, editor state, editable flags).
- **Split only** when a single file becomes too large to read or when a chunk is reused across unrelated features.
- Prefer names like `practice_association.ts` over many `association_*.ts` shards.
